    "body":  "关联 [Issue #50](https://github.com/odango-chan/ca-agent-next/issues/50)。本 PR 仅提交主干同步治理规范与审计计划；Issue #50 保持 OPEN，等待独立评审和实际收敛窗口复核。\n\n## Changes\n\n- Add `docs/规范/主干同步与收敛规范.md`: main as the sole formal integration baseline; functional-batch cadence; A/B/C/D classification; stacked PR ordering; merge gates; branch lifecycle; protection and stop/recovery rules.\n- Add `docs/治理/主干收敛计划.md`: current branch/PR/SR audit snapshot, exact SHAs, dependency order and blockers.\n- Update `Agent.md` to require the policy and plan for mainline work.\n- Update the document index and migration inventory.\n\n## Fixed audit baseline\n\n- Base: `main` @ `b2ed5eb84114f9c2556a0cd06ed974887b1b70ad`\n- Head: `docs/issue-50-mainline-convergence` @ `c4711fd0e9ff4f0654b20c747ba3d16d76bc729a`\n- Diff: 5 files (2 new governance documents, 3 governance/index entry updates).\n- The initial audit found 21 branches including main; the new Issue #50 delivery branch was created after that snapshot, so the current count is 22 including main.\n- PR #46 has advanced to `80f155835bc127547f0ef864c228b85514cd06c0`; latest Review Context #175 succeeded, but the existing Review events are still author COMMENTs only.\n- Phase 1 refresh reconciliation is now tracked by [Issue #53](https://github.com/odango-chan/ca-agent-next/issues/53) and [Draft PR #54](https://github.com/odango-chan/ca-agent-next/pull/54), targeting restore only. Current PR #54 Head `7452f60`; Review Context Runs #192/#193/#194 SUCCESS; not merged.\n- PR #48 remains Draft and its base SHA is older than the current #46 Head.\n- The plan distinguishes PRs merged into the temporary restore branch from PRs merged into main.\n\n## Integration note\n\nThis PR is based on main and updates shared governance files (`Agent.md`, document index, and migration inventory) that also have newer versions on the temporary restore branch. If this PR is later approved and merged, the restore branch must incorporate the resulting main changes and reconcile those shared paths before continuing the #44 → #45 → #46 → #48 stack. Do not merge the restore branch first and do not reuse old review/CI results after the base changes.\n\n## Review / safety boundary\n\n- Draft by design; the policy and audit need independent review.\n- This PR does not authorize or perform any PR merge, main push, rebase, force-push, branch deletion, or SR status change.\n- Review Context CI success, if present, is not a substitute for independent governance review or product acceptance.\n",
